Package: reprise
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: aodjo <jjoons2010@gmail.com>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/aodjo/Reprise
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libgl1, ca-certificates
Description: Menu bar music controller for MPRIS players
 Reprise follows whichever MPRIS player is playing and puts it one click
 away: album art, the track title and artist, a scrubber, volume, and
 synced lyrics, in a panel that opens from the system tray.
 .
 On GNOME a small shell extension, installed with this package, draws the
 entry in the top bar itself so the title scrolls smoothly. Enable it with
 "gnome-extensions enable reprise@junx.dev".
